<title>USA: TJX Cos Inc Q4 Jan 25 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>TJX Cos Inc Q4 Jan 25 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr	  $0.84		    $0.05</p>
<p> Oper income     75,522		   7,982</p>
<p> Net sales	 1,946,475		1,638,739</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  90,307,954	     74,422,222</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Oper shr	  $2.36		    $0.58</p>
<p> Oper income     213,826		  51,589</p>
<p> Net sales	 6,689,410		3,975,115</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  90,625,009	     73,133,349</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is TJX Cos Inc.</p>
<p>Period ended January 25, 1997.</p>
<p>All oper income figures after income tax provisions.</p>
<p>Prior year oper income includes $35 million pre-tax charge for closing T.J. Maxx stores. Prior Q4 figure would otherwise be $0.34.</p>
<p>1997 12-month oper income excludes $125 million after-tax gain on sale of Chadwick's of Boston, income from the discontinued Chadwick's operation and charge for early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>1996 12-month oper income excludes charge impact of sale of the Hit or Miss division, the operating results of both Chadwick's and Hit or Miss as well as an extraordinary charge for the early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
